  "body": "Also, I wonder if it's unnecessarily harsh on client implementors to expect them to implement rate limiting clientside.  I'd rather the c-s API was trivial to use, rather than having to worry about queueing and retry schemes for as common a case as flooding the server?\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SPEC-19)\n\n(Reported by @ara4n)\n",
